11
00:00:50,686 --> 00:01:00,562
6 positions, led by Arch Capital Group, ticker ACGL, Mondelez International, ticker MDLZ, American International Group, ticker AIG.

12
00:01:00,562 --> 00:01:10,814
Every line carries its share count, its entry, and its exit — because a position without a defined exit is not a position, it is a hope.

13
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:17,076
Now the part that makes this system different: the loop.

14
00:01:17,076 --> 00:01:19,414
Every morning OROS proposes.

15
00:01:19,414 --> 00:01:29,685
Every evening it grades its own call, journals the verdict, and adjusts its own risk before it is allowed to propose again.

16
00:01:29,685 --> 00:01:33,526
Inside the book today: 0 positions up, 6 down.

17
00:01:33,526 --> 00:01:35,864
