19
00:01:37,618 --> 00:01:42,461
Both go in the journal — wins and losses get the same ink.

20
00:01:42,461 --> 00:01:49,475
The honest scoreboard reads: expectancy -2.76% per trade over 1391 graded positions.

21
00:01:49,475 --> 00:01:56,322
